  <DOCID>begona</DOCID>
  <TIMEX3 tid="t0" type="DATE" value="2017-09-15T00:00:00" functionInDocument="CREATION_TIME" temporalFunction="false">2017-09-15</TIMEX3>
  <TEXT><EVENT eid="e1" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">KONTSULTAREN</EVENT> ARRAZOIA&#13;
<EVENT eid="e2" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Arnasestua</EVENT>&#13;
<EVENT eid="e3" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">AURREKARI</EVENT> PERTSONALAK&#13;
-75 urteko gizona.&#13;
-<EVENT eid="e4" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Alergiarik</EVENT> gabekoa.&#13;
-Optika batean <EVENT eid="e5" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">lan</EVENT> egin zuen.&#13;
-<EVENT eid="e6" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Erretzaile</EVENT> ohia.&#13;
-<EVENT eid="e7" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Hipertentsio</EVENT> arteriala. &#13;
<EVENT eid="e8" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Hiperurizemia</EVENT> eta <EVENT eid="e9" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">hezueria</EVENT>. &#13;
<EVENT eid="e10" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Obesitatea</EVENT>.&#13;
-<EVENT eid="e11" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">LAHS</EVENT>.&#13;
-<EVENT eid="e12" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Digestio-odoljarioa</EVENT> <EVENT eid="e13" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">ultzera</EVENT> peptiko batengatik <TIMEX3 tid="t1" type="DURATION" value="P4Y" temporalFunction="false">duela 4 urte</TIMEX3>.&#13;
-<EVENT eid="e14" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Gonalgia</EVENT>.&#13;
-Ohiko <EVENT eid="e15" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">tratamendua</EVENT>: <EVENT eid="e16" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Lansoprazol</EVENT> 30 mg (1-0-0); <EVENT eid="e17" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Torasemida</EVENT> 5 mg (1-0-0); <EVENT eid="e18" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Alopurinol</EVENT> 300 mg (0-1-0); <EVENT eid="e19" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Colchicina</EVENT> 1 mg/24 orduro; <EVENT eid="e20" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Ácido</EVENT> Alendrónico/Colecalciferol 70mg/5600 UI konprimitu bat astero).&#13;
&#13;
<TIMEX3 tid="t2" type="DATE" value="PRESENT_REF" temporalFunction="true">ORAINGO</TIMEX3> <EVENT eid="e21" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">GAIXOTASUNA</EVENT>&#13;
<TIMEX3 tid="t3" type="DURATION" value="P1M" temporalFunction="false">Azken hilabetean</TIMEX3> zehar <EVENT eid="e22" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">eztula</EVENT>, <EVENT eid="e23" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">karkaxa</EVENT> zurixka, <EVENT eid="e24" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">mialgiak</EVENT> eta <EVENT eid="e25" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">febrikula</EVENT> aurkeztu ditu. &#13;
Amoxicilinarekin eta torasemidarekin <EVENT eid="e26" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">tratatua</EVENT> izan arren, ez du <EVENT eid="e27" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">hobekuntzarik</EVENT> izan. &#13;
<TIMEX3 tid="t4" type="DURATION" value="PXD" temporalFunction="true">Azken egunetan</TIMEX3> esfortzu minimoetako <EVENT eid="e28" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">arnasestuarekin</EVENT> <EVENT eid="e29" class="ASPECTUAL" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">hasten</EVENT> da, <EVENT eid="e30" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">eztula</EVENT> gehiagorekin eta <EVENT eid="e31" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">karkaxa</EVENT> zurixka mantenduz. &#13;
<EVENT eid="e32" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Sukarrik</EVENT> ez. &#13;
<EVENT eid="e33" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Oliguriarik</EVENT> ez.&#13;
&#13;
<EVENT eid="e34" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">MIAKETA</EVENT> FISIKOA&#13;
<EVENT eid="e35" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">PA</EVENT> 102/95 mmHg <EVENT eid="e36" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">BM</EVENT> 105 taupada/min <EVENT eid="e37" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Tenp</EVENT> 36,8ºC O2 <EVENT eid="e38" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">asetasuna</EVENT> %96&#13;
<EVENT eid="e39" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Konorte</EVENT> eta <EVENT eid="e40" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">orientazio</EVENT> egokiak. &#13;
<EVENT eid="e41" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Hidratazio</EVENT> eta <EVENT eid="e42" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">perfusio</EVENT> onak. &#13;
<EVENT eid="e43" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Takipneikoa</EVENT>.&#13;
Burua eta lepoa: <EVENT eid="e44" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">pletorarik</EVENT> ez&#13;
Toraxa: bihotz <EVENT eid="e45" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">auskultazio</EVENT> erritmikoa, <EVENT eid="e46" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">murmuriorik</EVENT> gabe. &#13;
Biriketako <EVENT eid="e47" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">auskultazioa</EVENT>: <EVENT eid="e48" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">sibilante</EVENT> barreiatuak eta <EVENT eid="e49" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">krepitanteak</EVENT> oinaldeetan.&#13;
Sabelaldea: <EVENT eid="e50" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">biguna</EVENT> eta <EVENT eid="e51" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">deprimigarria</EVENT>, <EVENT eid="e52" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">minik</EVENT> gabekoa.&#13;
Beheko gorputz-adarrak: fobeadun <EVENT eid="e53" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">edema</EVENT> arinak&#13;
&#13;
<EVENT eid="e54" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">MIAKETA</EVENT> OSAGARRIAK&#13;
Toraxeko <EVENT eid="e55" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">erradiografia</EVENT>: aldebiko <EVENT eid="e56" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">patroi</EVENT> mikronodulillarra&#13;
<EVENT eid="e57" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Gasometria</EVENT> arteriala: <EVENT eid="e58" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">PO2</EVENT> 63; <EVENT eid="e59" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">PCO2</EVENT> 38; <EVENT eid="e60" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">pH</EVENT> 7.44, <EVENT eid="e61" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">BE</EVENT> 1.7; <EVENT eid="e62" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">HCO3</EVENT>-25.8; <EVENT eid="e63" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Sat</EVENT> %92&#13;
<EVENT eid="e64" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Odol-analisia</EVENT>: <EVENT eid="e65" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">albumina</EVENT> 3.19; <EVENT eid="e66" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">ALT</EVENT>/GPT 45, <EVENT eid="e67" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">PCR</EVENT> 5.23. &#13;
<EVENT eid="e68" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Gainontzekoa</EVENT> normala. &#13;
<EVENT eid="e69" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Hematimetria</EVENT>: <EVENT eid="e70" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Hb</EVENT> 13.4; <EVENT eid="e71" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Hto</EVENT> %41.2; <EVENT eid="e72" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">plaketak</EVENT> 155.000; <EVENT eid="e73" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">leukozitoak</EVENT> 8.200 (%75 <EVENT eid="e74" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">N</EVENT>; %11.2 <EVENT eid="e75" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">L</EVENT>)&#13;
<EVENT eid="e76" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Gernu-analisia</EVENT>: <EVENT eid="e77" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">proteinuria</EVENT> 30.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e78" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Antigenoak</EVENT>: Influenzae A, B <EVENT eid="e79" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">birusak</EVENT> eta <EVENT eid="e80" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">VRS</EVENT> negatiboak. &#13;
S.pneumoniae eta Legionella <EVENT eid="e81" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">antigenoak</EVENT> gernuan negatiboak.&#13;
&#13;
NEUMOLOGIA ZERBITZUAN <EVENT eid="e82" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">OSPITALARETZEA</EVENT>&#13;
Egindako <EVENT eid="e83" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">eskanerrean</EVENT> hurrengoa <EVENT eid="e84" class="REPORTING" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">aurkitu</EVENT> zen: torax aldean, biriketako aldebiko <EVENT eid="e85" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">patroi</EVENT> mikronodulillarra, gongoil hiliar eta mediastiniko eta <EVENT eid="e86" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">adenopatia</EVENT> paratrakeala; eta abdomen aldean, giltzurrun sinuen <EVENT eid="e87" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">infiltrazio</EVENT> hedatua eta <EVENT eid="e88" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">loditze</EVENT> parietal pieloureterala.&#13;
</TEXT>
